        "text": [
          "589,288 international students",
          "were enrolled in 2024.",
          "",
          "China, India and Nepal alone",
          "make up 51% of them.",
          "",
          "Malaysia is 6th (23,621),",
          "ahead of Indonesia and",
          "the Philippines."
